\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  God of Mercy has set me free,\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and forgiven all my sins
\par This good news keeps comfort my soul
\par and my faith in happiness.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par My soul, give all  praise to the Lord;
\par for His gift is in abundant
\par And His mercy have delivered
\par me from grips of satan now.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  For my sins shall be no burden,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Jesus is my Saviour now
\par My Jesus with His precious blood
\par have paid all my debt for me.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What I owe my Lord and Master
\par is over ten thousand times;
\par And if I'm to pay all these debt,
\par Then I shall forever die.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  For my sins are over burdened
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and my soul has come to grief:
\par And the wrath of the Mighty King
\par makes the poor to fear and shake.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And the Lord Jesus, mediator
\par has made it for me with God,
\par and so my pleading has touched Him
\par a pardon He gave to me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Now I'm free and new in Jesus,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 and cannot be filled with fear;
\par And the Lord God once have saved me;
\par Jesus the maker of peace.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par And in happiness I shall die,
\par then in faith, I'll give Him praise;
\par God of Mercy has set me free
\par \pard    and has comforted my soul.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

